assignment from a lexical address and an environment.  Validate both frame
depth and within-frame displacement.  A read of an unassigned cell must raise
the guest's unassigned-read error; an invalid address must not silently fall
back to a different variable with the same name.  Test shadowed names, an
outer captured binding, and assignment to a mutable binding.
@end quotation

